@startuml raja-ongkir-api

title Raja Ongkir API

actor "User" as user
participant "AI Agent" as bot
participant "Raja Ongkir" as raja_ongkir

user -> bot: [POST] /mobichat/chat
note over user: lokasi destinasi

bot -> bot: Extract Detail Lokasi
note over bot: provinsi, kota, kecamatan, kelurahan

||30||

group Cost Calculation Step by Step
    bot -> raja_ongkir: ""[GET] /v1/destination/province""
    bot <-- raja_ongkir: ""[200] province""

    ||10||

    bot -> raja_ongkir: ""[GET] /v1/destination/city/{provinceId}""
    bot <-- raja_ongkir: ""[200] cities""

    ||10||

    bot -> raja_ongkir: ""[GET] /v1/destination/district/{cityId}""
    bot <-- raja_ongkir: ""[200] district""

    ||10||

    bot -> raja_ongkir: ""[GET] /v1/destination/subdistrict/{districtId}""
    bot <-- raja_ongkir: ""[200] subdistricts""

    ||10||

    bot -> raja_ongkir: ""[POST] /v1/calculate/domestic-cost""
    bot <-- raja_ongkir: ""[200] cost""
end

||30||

group Cost Calculation Directly
    bot -> raja_ongkir: ""[GET] /v1/calculate/domestic-cost""
    note over bot
        cari lokasi alamat langsung 
        pake label/partial word
    end note

    bot <-- raja_ongkir: ""[200] locations""
    note over raja_ongkir 
        langsung balik province, district, 
        dan subdistrict id yang siap pakai
        untuk API calculate distance cost
    end note

    bot -> raja_ongkir: ""[POST] /v1/calculate/domestic-cost""
    note right of raja_ongkir
        - parameter menggunakan ""origin""<color:red>*</color> (district ID), 
        ""destination""<color:red>*</color> (district ID)
        ""weight""<color:red>*</color>, ""courier""<color:red>*</color>
        - courier -> digabung pake code, separator pakai "":""
        - balikan result nya:
        <code>
        {
          "meta": {
            "message": "...",
            "code": 200,
            "status": "success"
          },
          "data": [
            {
              "name": "JNE",
              "code": "jne",
              "service": "REG",
              "description": "Layanan Reguler",
              "cost": 18000,
              "etd": "2-3 Hari"
            }
          ]
        }
        </code>
        
    end note
    bot <-- raja_ongkir: ""[200] cost""
end

bot -> bot: Format response
bot -> user: ""[200] Response""

note over raja_ongkir
    **<size:18>Tambahan Informasi</size>**

    Pada group "Cost Calculation Step by Step", AI Agent akan 
    meminta data lokasi tujuan secara berurutan: provinsi, 
    kota/kabupaten, kecamatan, lalu kelurahan/subdistrict. 
    Setelah lengkap, ongkir dihitung lewat 
    endpoint /v1/calculate/domestic-cost.

    Informasi Tambahan
    - Paket
        - Free version
            - shipping API: **100/hari**
            - Payment & Qris API: **unlimited/hari**
        - Paid Version
            - Faster response time
            - Package: Personal
                - shipping API: **25.000/hari**
            - Package: Enterprise
                - shipping API: **50.000/hari**
    - Ada perbedaan antara API URLs untuk menghitung biaya
    rute domestik dan rute internasional

    Supported vendor ongkir
    - domestik
        - jne
        - sicepat
        - sap (SAP Express)
        - ninja
        - jnt
        - tiki
        - wahana
        - pos (Pos Indonesia)
        - sentral (Sentral Cargo)
        - lion
        - rex (Royal Express Asia)
    - internasional
        - jne
        - tiki
        - pos (Pos Indonesia)
end note

@enduml